I was a bit worried if you could hear it.

343
00:46:17,488 --> 00:46:21,688
え、こっちにはね、君らの声、よく聞こえるんだけど、
We can hear your voices really well from here,

344
00:46:21,688 --> 00:46:27,288
さすがにマイク通さないとちっちゃかったかなと思って。ね、お腹から出しましたけどね。
but I thought without a mic, our voices might have been too quiet. Yeah, we shouted from our stomachs, though.

345
00:46:27,288 --> 00:46:30,388
あ、聞こえた、ありがとう！
Ah, they heard us, thank you!

346
00:46:30,388 --> 00:46:35,888
